    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk if anyone actually loved 'me' though. they loved the brand. they loved the person on the screen. now that the screen is black, it's like that entire version of me just vanished. it's not even grief, it feels more like... i'm just a ghost inhabiting a body that doesn't have a purpose anymore. it feels hollow.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
