      "content": "but that's the thing... there is no 'authentic self' left to find. that person was the one who was connected to the world. the one who felt alive. now it's just this quiet, empty room. it honestly feels more logical to just let the rest of it go too. if the part that mattered is already gone, what's the point of keeping up the charade of a life?",
